  "details": "As the title says. In MM is fine.\n\nHow to reproduce:\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Open the user page in QM (Receive an invite or friend request and click \"...\" and \"View Profile\" OR click any user from the \"Friends\" page in the wings)\n\n3. Click \"Request Invite\" or \"Send Invite\"\n\n4. You'll see the VRC+ Advertisements even if you have VRC+",
